  "description": {
   "en": "Curses, spirits, and monsters - these strange and mysterious phenomena that have existed since time immemorial are collectively known as \"anomalies\". In order to minimize the damage they can cause, Anomaly Inspector Adashino Abi has another job today...",
   "ja": "奇々怪々な災害「奇象現象」を食い止めよ。呪い・心霊・怪異など、この世に起こる奇怪な災害の総称「奇象現象」。それらによる災害を最小限に減災するために、「奇象官」として働く化野アビのもとへ、今日も仕事が舞い込む…。"
  },
